      m_Calls: []
  m_text: '<b>Show or hide this panel</b>

    Menu button on the left controller,
    or Hide at the foot of the tabs.


    <b>Move anything</b>

    Grab its coloured
    sphere - reach out and grab it, or point at it from a distance and hold the trigger.
    The panel has one of its own, below it.


    <b>Lost the panel</b>

    Press
    Menu while facing away from it and it comes to you.


    <b>Nothing is drawing</b>

    Pick
    topics on the Topics tab: the laser scan and the point cloud start with none.


    <b>Two
    of something</b>

    Views tab, + on its row. The copy arrives beside the original
    with no topic; give it one on Topics. The red X there detaches a subscriber from
    its topic again.'
